#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0663 expect=noViolation domain=APDM
#note "DOMAIN=APDM: 4 characters, begins with AP, suffix DM is a published SDTM domain code -> no violation. W4 (PLAN-list-functions phase 0, scenarios-first on the pre-port engine)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library codelist-terms DOMAIN AE DM LB
dataset APDM label="Associated Persons Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col APID    type=Char label="Associated Persons Identifier"
---
S1 | APDM | AP001
